// EVOFRAC - exact rational arithmetic.  P/Q (op O) R/S -> P/Q
// O: 1 add, 2 subtract, 3 multiply, 4 divide.  Q,S > 0, fractions in lowest terms.
// Stays exact while every numerator/denominator is below 1E10 (all intermediates
// are then exact in the 14-digit float format). Otherwise sets V=1 (approximate)
// and continues in floating point; a sum that cancels to below 1E-10 of its
// larger term is treated as an exact 0 (rounding residue). Division by zero sets W=1.
// Clobbers: G H R S
If O=4:Then
If R=0:Then
1→W:0→P:1→Q:Return
End
S→H:R→S:H→R
If S<0:Then
⁻R→R:⁻S→S
End
End
If O=2:⁻R→R
If fPart(P) or fPart(R):1→V
If not(V):Then
If O≥3:Then
If P=0 or R=0:Then
0→P:1→Q
Else
gcd(abs(P),S)→G:gcd(abs(R),Q)→H
If abs(P/G)abs(R/H)<ᴇ10 and (Q/H)(S/G)<ᴇ10:Then
(P/G)(R/H)→P:(Q/H)(S/G)→Q
Else
1→V
End
End
Else
gcd(Q,S)→G
If abs(P)(S/G)<5ᴇ9 and abs(R)(Q/G)<5ᴇ9 and Q(S/G)<ᴇ10:Then
P(S/G)+R(Q/G)→P:Q(S/G)→Q
If P=0:Then
1→Q
Else
gcd(abs(P),Q)→G:P/G→P:Q/G→Q
End
Else
1→V
End
End
End
If V:Then
If O≥3:Then
PR/(QS)→P
Else
max(abs(P/Q),abs(R/S))→H
P/Q+R/S→P
If abs(P)<ᴇ⁻10H:0→P
End
1→Q
End
